"<div>\n<i class=\"NoteType\">\nPerson Note\n</i>\n<div class=\"grampsstylednote\">\n<p>\nLillian Harris Knox\n</p>\n<p>\nBirth<br />\n    1 Sep 1912<br />\n    Arkadelphia, Clark County, Arkansas, USA<br />\nDeath<br />\n    31 Jan 1979 (aged 66)<br />\n    Arkadelphia, Clark County, Arkansas, USA<br />\nBurial<br />\n    Bethlehem African American Cemetery<br />\n    Joan, Clark County, Arkansas, USA<br />\nMemorial ID<br />\n    141826124 \u00b7 View Source \n</p>\n<p>\nLillian's parents are James H Harris and Martha Hicks, both from North Carolina. Her known siblings are Delia,Jane, Newla, Stevie, Emma, Willie, Frank, Arlene and Eva Harris.\n</p>\n<p>\nShe first married Benjamin M Browning, April 17, 1932 in Clark County, Arkansas. Their known children are Benjamin, Lois and Marie Browning.\n</p>\n<p>\nShe second married Avery Knox, May 18, 1938 in Clark County, Arkansas. Their known children are Zelma Marie, Geneva, Thelma, Flora, Kathleen, Irene and Martha J Knox.\n</p>\n<p>\n Maintained by: Kathy Stroope Veasey<br />\nOriginally Created by: FrankA.<br />\nAdded: 26 Jan 2015<br />\nFind a Grave Memorial ID: 141826124 \n</p>\n<p>\n&nbsp;\n</p>\n<p>\nhttps://www.findagrave.com/memorial/141826124/lillian-knox#source\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>",
