"<div>\n<i class=\"NoteType\">\nLink\n</i>\n<div class=\"grampsstylednote\">\n<p>\nhttps://sites.rootsweb.com/~dallasar/ps32/ps32_338.html\n</p>\n<p>\n&nbsp;\n</p>\n<p>\nNameDorethia OWENS211, O520<br />\nBirth17 Feb 1952, Sparkman, Dallas County, Arkansas<br />\nDeath9 Nov 2004, Portland, Oregon211 Age: 52<br />\nBurialHarmony Cemetery, Sparkman, Dallas County, Arkansas211<br />\nFatherGee OWENS (1911-2001)<br />\nMotherMae Girtha DAILEY (1914-)<br />\nSpouses<br />\n1Rev. Douglas P. NEWBURN211, N165<br />\nChildrenAmanda P.<br />\n Megan D.<br />\n Monica E.<br />\n Dena S.<br />\n Douglas (Step)<br />\nObituary Notices Notes for Dorethia OWENS<br />\nDorethia O. Newburn\n</p>\n<p>\nPublished: Friday, November 12, 2004 1:37 PM CST\n</p>\n<p>\nPORTLAND, Ore. -- Dorethia Owens Newburn, 52, of Portland, Ore., formerly of Arkadelphia, died Nov. 9, 2004, at Gateway Care Center in Portland. She was born Feb. 17, 1952, in Sparkman, daughter of Mae Girtha Dailey Owens and the late Gee Owens. She was a graduate of Sparkman High School, a member of Antioch Baptist Church in Portland and a former member of Harmony Baptist and Mt. Morriah Baptist churches in Arkansas.\n</p>\n<p>\nSurvivors include: Her husband, Rev. Douglas P. Newburn; four daughters, Amanda P. Newburn and Megan D. Newburn of Portland, Monica E. Newburn of Grand Prairie, Texas, and Dena S. Traylor of Arkadelphia; a stepson, Douglas Newburn of Hot Springs; her mother, Mae Girtha Owens of Sparkman; two brothers, Carlton V. Owens of Warren and Freddie L. Owens of Arkadelphia; three sisters, Geneva O. Hunter of Arkadelphia, Darlene O. Simpson of Gurdon and Marilyn F. Owens of Sherwood; and seven grandchildren.\n</p>\n<p>\nFuneral will be 2:30 p.m. Saturday in Harmony Baptist Church at Sparkman with Rev. J.L. Newborn officiating. Burial will be in Harmony Community Cemetery under the direction of Williams Funeral Home.\n</p>\n<p>\nVisitation is 3-7 p.m. today and 9 a.m.-noon Saturday at the funeral home.<br />\n*-*-*-*-*-*-*-*-*-*-*-*-*-*-*-*-*-*<br />\nPublished: Thursday, November 11, 2004 1:03 PM CST\n</p>\n<p>\nDorethia O. Newburn\n</p>\n<p>\nPORTLAND, Ore. -- Dorethia Owens Newburn, 52, of Portland, Ore., formerly of Arkadelphia, died Nov. 9, 2004.\n</p>\n<p>\nFuneral will be at 2:30 p.m. Saturday at Harmony Baptist Church of Sparkman. Arrnagements are by Williams Funeral Home.\n</p>\n<p>\n&nbsp;\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>",
